  "user_request_original": "Design a 24-layer planar dielectric coating on fused silica substrate using alternating TiO2 (Siefke) and SiO2 (Gao) layers. Incident medium is air. Optimize all 24 layer thicknesses individually with bounds 50-120 nm per layer. Target: maximize reflectance in 450-650 nm wavelength band, maximize transmittance in 700-1000 nm wavelength band. Incidence angle is 45 degrees. Treat both s and p polarizations (unpolarized light). Use gradient-based thickness optimization. Material names: TiO2 (Siefke) for titanium dioxide, SiO2 (Gao) for silicon dioxide. Substrate: fused silica (use SiO2 (Gao) if fused silica not separately resolved). Maximum 24 layers fixed. Report best_target_score, valid_candidates count, tightest_margin, and final thicknesses_nm array.",
